  "body": "See https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/issues/243. We're somewhat inconsistent in a number of places, e.g., we don't proceed all records with Record or equivalent literal and we don't always have a space after that literal (or no space).\r\n\r\nWe should wait with this until https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/pull/1143 lands.",
